s are accepted. The value carries over only after focus leaves the whole group (moving focus between years and months does not commit, so both can be cleared together): 0 years 13 months becomes 1 year 1 month, 13 months in total.",[349,353,354],{},"The three bindings can be used alone or together. When the parent fills in total months and years\u002Fmonths that conflict, total months win; when only years\u002Fmonths are filled in, they are summed again and carried over.",[349,356,357,358,361,362,365],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[303,359,360],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[303,363,364],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[327,367,369],{"id":368},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[300,371,372],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[342,374],{"name":375},"months-compact",[327,377,379],{"id":378},"variants","Variants",[300,381,382,383,310,386,389,390,393],{},"Uses the ",[303,384,385],{},"color",[303,387,388],{},"highlight"," of ",[303,391,392],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[342,395],{"name":396},"months-color",[327,398,400],{"id":399},"size-and-states","Size and states",[300,402,403,404,407],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[316,405,102],{"href":406},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[342,409],{"name":410},"months-states",[322,412,414],{"id":413},"examples","Examples",[327,416,418],{"id":417},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[300,420,421,42